224 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 214 0 R
/E (The general direction of the game relates to memories fading or becoming more prominent. This is shown in 2 ways, through the atmosphere and environment \(including streets, cars, weather, etc.\) and through the buildings the player delivers to. For example, a successful delivery may detail a house more and/or make it more vibrant. On the contrary, a failed delivery may remove details from buildings, blur some parts of it, and/or make the color scheme duller. The environment would work in the same way but affected by story progression instead, with sunny days with calm streets at the start, and more chaotic weather and street-life near the end.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
